into how food and exercise

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.180
and other activities and
even how well I was sleeping

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.610
or how poorly I might
happen to be sleeping

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.560
impact my blood glucose levels.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.510
It even taught me that the sauna,

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.000
that generating a lot of heat in my body,

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.950
was changing my blood glucose levels,

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.210
which turned out to inform

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.940
how I should shift my eating
patterns, foods I should eat,

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:13.860
timing of eat, and so on and so forth.

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:15.000
It really gave me great insight

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.490
